WEBVTT

00:07:59.038 --> 00:08:00.746
Here's number three.

00:08:00.788 --> 00:08:03.329
Think beyond the schedule.

00:08:03.371 --> 00:08:04.829
Guess what? The future of work

00:08:04.871 --> 00:08:07.829
is not two days
that you get to work from home.

00:08:07.871 --> 00:08:11.288
This is our chance right now

00:08:11.329 --> 00:08:15.704
to reimagine, reduce, replace
or even eliminate things

00:08:15.746 --> 00:08:17.204
like long commutes,

00:08:17.246 --> 00:08:19.663
endless meetings
with too many people there,

00:08:19.704 --> 00:08:21.829
recurring meetings that never go away,

00:08:21.871 --> 00:08:25.538
synchronous work, silos,
command-and-control leaders,

00:08:25.579 --> 00:08:26.871
administrivia --

00:08:26.913 --> 00:08:30.413
that's my word for the low-value stuff
that clogs our calendars.